title: "urdu-tts-pronunciation"
abstract: "An open source agent skill and Python toolkit that helps AI voices pronounce Urdu correctly: a list of words text-to-speech engines get wrong with the spelling that fixes each, a script linter, and a take checker that uses Whisper transcripts in Urdu, English and Devanagari to find mispronounced, swallowed or repeated words before a person listens."
